## Level 2: Problem & Solution - Detailed Analysis Diagram

### Recommended Type: Sequence Diagram with Alt Branches

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Ext as Extension MV3
    participant Clip as Clipboard API
    participant Desk as Desktop App
    participant AI as AI Interface

    User->>Ext: Copy PII Data ($555-1234)
    
    alt Auto-redaction Enabled
        Ext->>Clip: Intercept Write Event
        loop Category Check
            Ext->>Desk: Verify Exclusion List (Numbers, PasswordMgr)
            Desk->>Ext: Return allowed/cleared status
        end
        Ext->>Ext: Generate [phone:hash] placeholder
    else Manual Override ⌘⇧R
        User->>User: Trigger Hotkey
        User->>Clip: Force redact regardless exclusion
    end

    Alt Restore Operation?
        User->>_auto_check: Background scan
        
        alt Paste has placeholders
            User->>AI: Paste has placeholders
            AI-->>Ext: Detect restore opportunity
            Ext->>Clip: Fetch original from DB
            Clip-->>User: Return PI cleared content
        end

    note right of Ext: State database tracks: 137 records, 5 excluded apps, active status
    
```

