## Level 3: Architecture - Technical System Diagram

### Recommended Type: Class Diagram with Stereotypes and Associations

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class DigitalCurator{
        +String version "v1.0"
         +boolean isProtected
         +void processClipboard()
     }

    class ExtensionMV3 {
          <<module>>
          -ServiceWorker bgWorker
          -BackgroundScript contentScripts
          +Promise syncWithDesktop() async
     }

    class DesktopApp { 
          <<application>>
          #TrayMenu menuController
          #DoltDB dbConnection
          +int syncIntervalMs
          -void handleTrayAction()
     }

    class StateDatabase {
         <<entity>>
         +String schemaPath "/dolt/tracking"
         +-Record[] recordsPK "tracked entries"
         +-Dict exclusions "excluded apps"
     }

    class ClipboardMonitor { 
          <<service>>
          -PII[] piiPatterns
          +String detectCategory(ClipboardContent) string
          +boolean isExcluded(URL) bool
     }

    DigitalCurator ..> StateDatabase : manages
    ExtensionMV3 --> ClipboardMonitor : uses
    DesktopApp ..> StateDatabase : queries  
    StateDatabase "1" o-- "*" RecordEntry : contains
    ClipboardMonitor --> PIIEntity : identifies

```

