## State Machine: Protection Modes FSM (Extension Level Process)

### Recommended Type: Finite State Machine with Mode Transitions

*Showing how the extension toggles between protection states*

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    title Digital Curator - Protection Mode Controller
    
    [*] --> Idle : Extension Load
    Idle --> Monitoring : Ready Event \\ DB Loaded
    
    state Monitoring {
        direction TB
        [*] --> WatchClipboard
        ClipboardChanged --> DetectPII : on each write
        DetectPII --> CheckExclusion : pattern match \\ "contains PII"
        
        CheckExclusion --> ApplyRedaction : not excluded app
        CheckExclusion --> AllowPassthrough : Numbers/LLM tools etc.
        
        ApplyRedaction --> GeneratePlaceholder : category+content hash
        GeneratePlaceholder --> SyncWithDB : dolt push \\ record_id++
    }

    Monitoring --> Paused : Tray Toggle OFF
    Paused --> Monitoring : Tray Toggle ON
    Monitoring --> ErrorState : DB write failure | Network timeout
    
    note right of Idle :: "Initial state - no protection yet"\nNote: Will transition to monitoring once ready\\nDatabase connection established

```

